  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You blend yourself with shadow, losing visual definition. For the duration, while in dim light or darkness, you gain a +2 status bonus to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hide} and @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.VMozDqMMuK5kpoX4]{Sneak}. If you end your turn outside of dim light or darkness, the spell ends.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (6th) </strong>You do not need to sustain the spell.<br /><br /></p>"
    },
